[{"id":"stateLabel8","name":"Thendula","legend":""},{"id":"marker81","name":"Balan Mausoleum","legend":"A foreboding necropolis shrouded in perpetual darkness, where eerie whispers echo through the winding corridors and spectral guardians stand watch over the tombs of long-forgotten souls."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Warden Crypt","legend":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Crafther Tomb","legend":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/12594\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker85","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/10749\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker86","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/13612\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"stateLabel5","name":"","legend":""},{"id":"marker87","name":"Skiple Volcano","legend":"Active volcano. Height: 16540 ft."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Mount Reateskirk","legend":"Active volcano. Height: 19962 ft."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Mouryteston Volcano","legend":"Dormant volcano. Height: 19962 ft."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Tumundaza Hot Springs","legend":"A geothermal springs with naturally heated water that provide relaxation 